{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7d19b386dd3261541f430aee80b790baa1558ca4af88969ac829edf8dcf378be", "ja": "（美也に頼まれて、本番の舞台となる劇場の\nステージで、最後の調整をしている）", "zh": "（受美也所托，我们正在正式演出剧场的舞台上做最后的调整。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "001c5e00a5e43e0e8fc5e877f20b914fe712618ed67bd47fafca5b3d409b5e4f", "ja": "明日は、この会場いっぱいに、\nお客さんが入るんですね～。", "zh": "明天，这个会场里就会坐满客人了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1002_p", "source_sha256": "782cb7ab34415021f9e26166d1d7a6f6522402cf905c8ab2ac864d675283cc2e", "ja": "初日のチケットはソールドアウトしてるからな。\n今からお客さんの感想が楽しみだよ。", "zh": "首日的门票已经售罄了。\n我现在就很期待客人们的反馈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "e023dc19df0fbe5951b4ba65bab7a8b629e5eeda017f9bd1867272aea423f12a", "ja": "はい～。私も、とっても楽しみですよ～。", "zh": "是的～我也非常期待哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "1ffd0dfd2bdd3c8532f541f5709544d64e01a2d06344f94fdaeceaa67aaeddef", "ja": "{$P$}さん。私に、\nなる役を任せてくれて、ありがとうございました～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。谢谢您把\n这个角色交给我～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3eed33896143e13d634f964f5caf5522e3cb0d090430dfd3d8e66f0aeaaf53d2", "ja": "うん。というか、本番は明日からだけど……\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯。话说回来，正式演出是从明天开始，不过……\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "38f9dd3d2b373246a5591fd859dac5ce172368a45f4f86b5956b434fd96fdb51", "ja": "稽古に入る前に、思ったんです。杏奈ちゃんは、\nステージに立つと別人になりますよね～。", "zh": "在开始排练之前，我就在想。杏奈一站上舞台，就会变成另一个人呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "b1572bd3e1714999ede2ec87cbce21fd38db7bd767ac0ac304eab00e02a3152b", "ja": "まるで将棋の駒が『成る』ように、\nステージに立てばアイドルに『なる』……。", "zh": "简直就像棋子“升变”一样，一站上舞台，就“成为”偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "3b76cfc293b189098f63bbf13407822bc610b4a0a1baaf36d79b7ab998aa4440", "ja": "だから私より、杏奈ちゃんの方が……三船なるに\n相応しいのではないかと思っていたんです～。", "zh": "所以，比起我，我一直觉得杏奈更适合……成为“三船”呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1009_p", "source_sha256": "473a68dc0e62d4d2f31fd77c0c8af1d58d6f802b3f6fb6a2b2cdcd90ec46e6b8", "ja": "そんな事を考えてたのか……。", "zh": "原来你一直在想这种事啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "41e727b75ce357bb4e462fcd8c47df85edb23d0dc07ffc593c333678436a0f12", "ja": "はい～。でも、せっかくなるが主人公の話ですから。\n私も、簡単に手放す気はありませんでした～。", "zh": "是呀～不过，难得是成为主角的机会嘛。\n我也没打算轻易放弃呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "fa48bdf2821702de43505442c3b560a223dba3dde35d7532f4747ea1bc08712c", "ja": "杏奈ちゃんから、何かひとつでも盗めないか、\n稽古中はじっと見ていました～。むふふ。", "zh": "我一直盯着杏奈，想着能不能从她那里学到哪怕一样东西～。唔呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "cdff95030f0468cb71e9e12e26c9e9ca4cbc15a4c6378df6a70e852b47bfb376", "ja": "お陰で、いろいろ気づけたこともありましたし。\n結果オーライ、ですよ～。", "zh": "多亏了她，我也注意到了不少东西。\n结果还不错啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1013_p", "source_sha256": "261aba00a0f3ab972ce20028f8a1e389733ea487e8592783db3cf5c115bf630b", "ja": "それなら良かった。\n本番、楽しみにしてるよ。", "zh": "那就好。\n我很期待你在正式演出中的表现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "938bc689be917845a2e788b2d188cb428e8a66473f70a91a30170ef54519d627", "ja": "はい～。私のなるがお客さんたちに、どんな風に\n感じてもらえるのか……ワクワクしますな～。", "zh": "是呀～真期待大家会如何感受我的演出……让人心里直痒痒的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0483_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "66c9d6d4e97c9e8d40f1a2f2f802da3c5c4fb8245721305c7e2b63c198455173", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、\n私に期待していてくださいね～♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生也请多多期待我的表现哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
